WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:03.000
A cyan point traces an orbit. Every idea starts somewhere.

00:03.000 --> 00:06.000
cAshIo. Your personal AI command center.

00:06.000 --> 00:10.000
The idea: introduce cAshIo with a memorable film and a welcoming first screen.

00:10.000 --> 00:13.000
